{"version":1,"content":"<p>在經歷多年法律訴訟後，澳大利亞聯邦法院對蘋果作出一系列反壟斷整改要求，責令其允許第三方應用商店進入iOS生態，並取消限制開發者引導用户使用外部支付方式的做法。相關要求被外界普遍視為與歐盟《數字市場法案》（DMA）推動的改革高度相似，標誌着蘋果在全球範圍內面臨的新一輪監管壓力。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583286.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:42.033051+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:45:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"cf82f3f069f2c22f3517735ab5305d79af124c5c9a399aebaf19d4a378e66723","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}